    {
      "number": 5,
      "region_id": 5,
      "source_text": "Speech is generated only after a paragraph passes basic checks. Empty results and very low recognition confidence request another image Extremely long regions are divided at sentence boundaries, while short neighbouring lines may be joined so the voice does not pause after every label fragment Numbers. units. dates. and warning symbols receive special attention because a fluent sentence can still be dangerous when one measurement is wrong The interface can optionally read the source paragraph first and the translated paragraph second This slower mode helps during evaluation and allows bilingual users to notice recognition mistakes before acting on the result",
